# Third-party reference PDFs — 93 MB of publisher copies fetched by
# fetch_references.py. Not ours to redistribute on a public repo, and git keeps
# them in history forever once pushed. refs.bib and REFERENCES.md record every
# one of them; re-fetch with `python fetch_references.py`.
